---
// Importa tus componentes si es necesario, pero este es autónomo.
---

<section class="about-me-section" id="sobre-mi">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      
      <div class="image-column">
        <div class="background-decorations">
          <div class="green-arch"></div>
          <div class="text-arch">
Ñ
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="photo-wrapper">
          <img src="danielCordero.png" alt="Daniel Cordero Sonriendo" class="main-photo" />
          <div class="photo-badge">Coach • Mentor • Inspiración</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="content-column">
        <span class="label-tiny">SOBRE MÍ</span>
        <h1>Hola, soy Daniel Cordero</h1>
        <p class="titles">Coach motivacional | Creador de contenido</p>
        
        <div class="main-text">
          <p>
            Soy apasionado por ayudar a madres a encontrar esperanza, sanación y dirección en medio de los desafíos de la vida.
          </p>
          <p>
            A través de la mentalidad, la Palabra de Dios y herramientas prácticas, te acompaño a transformar tu corazón, tu hogar y tu futuro.
          </p>
        </div>

        <blockquote class="mission-quote">
          <p class="mission-text">
            <span class="quote-marks">“</span>
            Mi misión es recordarte que Dios no solo puede cambiar tu historia, sino la de tu familia.
            <span class="quote-marks">”</span>
          </p>
        </blockquote>

        <div class="cta-wrapper">
          <a href="#" class="cta-button">CONOCE MÁS SOBRE MÍ</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Open+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700&display=swap');

  .about-me-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f7f3ec 0%, #fcf8f1 100%);
    padding: 88px 0;
    font-family: 'Open Sans', sans-serif;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 992px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 460px 1fr;
      gap: 64px;
    }
  }

  .image-column {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 460px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 16px 0 16px 16px;
  }

  .background-decorations {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .green-arch {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -40px;
    left: -90px;
    width: 320px;
    height: 460px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #6a8264 0%, #788f6f 100%);
    border-radius: 220px 220px 0 0;
    opacity: 0.95;
    transform: rotate(-8deg);
  }

  .text-arch {
    position: absolute;
    top: 8px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .curved-text {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #6a8264;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    white-space: nowrap;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    transform: rotate(-12deg);
  }

  .photo-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    padding: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
    border: 1px solid rgba(106, 130, 100, 0.16);
    border-radius: 32px;
    box-shadow: 0 22px 60px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }

  .main-photo {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 24px;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  }

  .photo-badge {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 28px;
    left: 28px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
    color: #41543c;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
  }

  .content-column {
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .label-tiny {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #6a8264;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #2f3b31;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }

  .titles {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #bfa37d;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
  }

  .main-text p {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #5f6b63;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .mission-quote {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6a8264 0%, #51644c 100%);
    padding: 28px 30px;
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    border-radius: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(81, 100, 76, 0.16);
  }

  .mission-text {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: white;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .quote-marks {
    font-size: 40px;
    color: #f2d8a7;
    line-height: 0;
    vertical-align: sub;
  }

  .cta-wrapper {
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  .cta-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6a8264 0%, #4d6044 100%);
    color: white;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 16px 30px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(81, 100, 76, 0.2);
  }

  .cta-button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 26px rgba(81, 100, 76, 0.24);
  }

  @media (max-width: 991px) {
    .about-me-section {
      padding: 60px 0;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .titles {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .mission-text {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .green-arch {
      bottom: -30px;
      left: -70px;
      width: 260px;
      height: 400px;
    }
  }
</style>